{"parse":{"title":"极限解放/凛冬猎手","pageid":7183,"revid":17034,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%87%9B%E5%86%AC%E7%8C%8E%E6%89%8B&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%87%9B%E5%86%AC%E7%8C%8E%E6%89%8B&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%87%9B%E5%86%AC%E7%8C%8E%E6%89%8B&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>凛冬猎手</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.87.9B.E5.86.AC.E7.8C.8E.E6.89.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"凛冬猎手\"><b>凛冬猎手</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">极限解放详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"3\"><img alt=\"极限解放 凛冬猎手.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ec/buldygghl85slq6u9gn6vrp5pu1m61k.png/80px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%87%9B%E5%86%AC%E7%8C%8E%E6%89%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ec/buldygghl85slq6u9gn6vrp5pu1m61k.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%87%9B%E5%86%AC%E7%8C%8E%E6%89%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/ec/buldygghl85slq6u9gn6vrp5pu1m61k.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />凛冬猎手\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">盛宴</font></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"个性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">个性</font></span></span>]附加伤害获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无视守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">无视守护</font></span></span>]标签。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">永霜地面</font></span>]变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，攻击时额外对<font color=\"#ed7950\">1*3</font>区域内所有敌人施加<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"伤口\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">伤口</font></span></span>]。<br />✦在冰冻地形格行走时，前<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格不消耗移动力。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">盛宴</font></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"个性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">个性</font></span></span>]附加伤害获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无视守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">无视守护</font></span></span>]标签。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">永霜地面</font></span>]变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，攻击时额外对<font color=\"#ed7950\">1*3</font>区域内所有敌人施加<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"伤口\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">伤口</font></span></span>]，首次释放时不消耗能量。<br />✦在冰冻地形格行走时，前<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格不消耗移动力。<br />✦处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形格时，技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">盛宴</font></span>]能量消耗减少<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>点；主动攻击前获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲伤害2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲伤害2</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">盛宴</font></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"个性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">个性</font></span></span>]附加伤害获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无视守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">无视守护</font></span></span>]标签。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">永霜地面</font></span>]变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，攻击时额外对<font color=\"#ed7950\">1*3</font>区域内所有敌人施加<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"伤口\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">伤口</font></span></span>]，释放能量消耗减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>，首次不消耗能量。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"个性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">个性</font></span></span>]附加伤害每回合可触发次数额外加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>。在冰冻地形格行走时，前<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格不消耗移动力。<br />✦处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形格时，技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">盛宴</font></span>]能量消耗减少<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>点；主动攻击前获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击3\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击3</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲伤害3\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲伤害3</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲暴击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲暴击2</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲暴伤1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲暴伤1</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"覆雪之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/db/odghvivgd945bs5bdajzn9jeom0r382.png/40px-%E8%A6%86%E9%9B%AA%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"l